    "title": "Judson Board president says she gave 10 warnings before trustee was escorted from meeting - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Karina Hollingsworth ,\n1 days ago SAN ANTONIO, Tx — Explosive board meetings in Judson ISD are starting to become the norm in the school district. Most recently Board President Monica Ryan asked the police to escort District 1 Trustee Suzanne Kenoyer out of the building after she questioned an agenda item about hiring a new superintendent. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
